'''Shakurel Panda''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and can be unlocked by purchasing a special sale which contains Shakurel Panda and 500 [[Cat Food]] during the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 500
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Shakurel Panda
|name2 = Shakurel Panda CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shakurel Panda CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cat's Health and Damage are actually a bit good for early game and even mid game, but late game, Zombies just get way too strong for him, killing him almost instantly, not even mentioning his single target and long recharge and gets outclassed by Vaulter Cat, Ubers and other cats.

{{Job|Classification = Melee}}

